  "label": "Military Metaphor",
  "description": "The use of military terminology and imagery (e.g., 'battalion', 'commander', 'reinforcements') to describe or evaluate a group, often to imply strength, discipline, or capability. In this context, it is used pejoratively to suggest that transgender individuals are weak or require constant support, reinforcing harmful stereotypes.",
